1
00:00:05,720 --> 00:00:06,097
J-Jen…

2
00:00:06,655 --> 00:00:07,783
Jenderal Muda?

3
00:00:08,320 --> 00:00:09,368
Salah orang.

4
00:00:09,757 --> 00:00:11,444
Hamba Du Tie,

5
00:00:11,511 --> 00:00:13,757
menghadap Jenderal Muda!

6
00:00:15,562 --> 00:00:15,975
Tadi panggil siapa?

7
00:00:16,513 --> 00:00:17,469
Jenderal apa?

8
00:00:17,813 --> 00:00:20,125
Ini istri saya,

9
00:00:20,213 --> 00:00:20,681
mirip, kan?

10
00:00:21,354 --> 00:00:22,130
Mirip!

11
00:00:22,839 --> 00:00:23,527
Mirip sekali!

12
00:00:26,216 --> 00:00:26,400
Pak,

13
00:00:26,794 --> 00:00:28,160
Minum semangkuk?

14
00:00:29,790 --> 00:00:31,381
Saya di pasukan keluarga Qin,

15
00:00:31,563 --> 00:00:33,713
dua puluh tahun memanggul panji.

16
00:00:33,789 --> 00:00:35,160
Kaki ini

17
00:00:35,859 --> 00:00:38,066
tertinggal di perbatasan utara.

18
00:00:38,139 --> 00:00:38,433
Jadi dia…

19
00:00:39,097 --> 00:00:40,266
Jenderal Muda dari keluarga siapa?

20
00:00:40,971 --> 00:00:41,495
Ayahnya

21
00:00:41,660 --> 00:00:44,815
Jenderal Penjaga Utara, Qin Lieshan.

22
00:00:45,264 --> 00:00:46,359
Istana bilang dia

23
00:00:46,791 --> 00:00:49,356
menjual peta pertahanan perbatasan ke Shuomo.

24
00:00:49,815 --> 00:00:51,034
Keluarga Qin disita,

25
00:00:51,189 --> 00:00:52,241
semua tercerai-berai.

26
00:00:52,918 --> 00:00:53,528
Aku tak percaya!

27
00:00:53,592 --> 00:00:56,027
Jenderal tak mungkin jual negara!

28
00:00:56,105 --> 00:00:58,278
Data tokoh diperbarui:

29
00:00:58,361 --> 00:01:01,816
Qin Shuang, putri Jenderal Penjaga Utara.

30
00:01:02,093 --> 00:01:02,370
Pak,

31
00:01:02,706 --> 00:01:03,987
tolong cari tahu di mana Jenderal.

32
00:01:04,488 --> 00:01:05,608
Nyawaku ini

33
00:01:05,773 --> 00:01:07,151
memang milik keluarga Qin.

34
00:01:07,912 --> 00:01:08,457
Dia…

35
00:01:08,519 --> 00:01:09,546
baik-baik saja?

36
00:01:10,090 --> 00:01:12,310
Dia sudah bisa senyum.

37
00:01:12,396 --> 00:01:13,591
Bisa senyum, syukurlah,

38
00:01:13,651 --> 00:01:14,600
syukurlah.

39
00:01:14,841 --> 00:01:16,065
Kak Qin seharian nggak bicara,

40
00:01:16,616 --> 00:01:17,598
hibur dia sana.

41
00:01:17,713 --> 00:01:18,216
Aku?

42
00:01:24,113 --> 00:01:24,942
Dari mana ini?

43
00:01:25,541 --> 00:01:26,354
Di peti buku lama

44
00:01:26,804 --> 00:01:27,457
aku temukan.

45
00:01:28,097 --> 00:01:28,926
…Bukan apa-apa.

46
00:01:31,297 --> 00:01:31,966
Bapak tadi siang

47
00:01:32,520 --> 00:01:33,780
cerita soal keluargamu.

48
00:01:33,995 --> 00:01:34,690
Dia bilang apa lagi?

49
00:01:35,195 --> 00:01:36,273
Katanya ayahmu

50
00:01:36,688 --> 00:01:37,925
tak menjual negara.

51
00:01:40,521 --> 00:01:42,053
Kalau aku putri pesakitan,

52
00:01:42,715 --> 00:01:43,880
kamu masih mau aku?
